1666 002431* 0375          AND     (3)             / START BY ACTIVATING THE PROPER CHARACTER SET
1667 002432* 7450          SNA                     / EXCEPTION, TEST FOR GRAPHICS SET SELECTION 0
1668 002433* 5264          JMP     TCTEC           / NOT ALLOWED, DISPLAY IT AS A NORMAL DEAD/M244
