2845               
2846               /       ESAPTR  ADVANCE CURPTR 1 CHARACTER
2847               /
2848               /       THIS ROUTINE WILL ADVANCE TO THE NEXT NON-NULL CHARACTER AFTER
2849               /       THE CURRENT POSITION.  IT UPDATES CURPTR TO POINT TO THIS
