6274               
6275               / GLOBAL SEARCH FLAG CHECK ROUTINE
6276               / THIS ROUTINE IS BRANCHED TO FROM THE EDITORS INPUT CHAR WAIT LOOP
6277               / AT SYMBOL "EDICHR" TO SEE IF THE GLOBAL SEARCH FLAG (GSRF) IS SET
6278               / IF IT IS SET, WE CALL IN THE REPLACE OVERLAY TO CONTINUE THE OPERATION
6279               / THE SEARCH AND SELECT OVERLAY WILL COME HERE WHEN THE DESIRED TEXT
6280               / STRING IS FOUND IN THE DOCUMENT.  THIS ROUTINE WILL THEN CALL IN THE
6281               / REPLACE OVERLAY, WHICH THEN CALLS IN THE SEARCH AND SELECT OVERLAY TO
6282               / CONTINUE.  REACHING THE END OF THE DOCUMENT OR A GOLD+HALT WILL
6283               / TERMINATE THE PROCESS.
6284               
6285               GSRCK,  XX
undefined             	 ^
     016143  0000  
6286 016144  1173          TAD     GSRF            / GET THE GLOBAL SEARCH AND REPLACE FLAG
6287 016145  7650          SNA CLA                 / IS IT SET?
6288 016146  5743          JMP I   GSRCK           / NO, RETURN TO CALLER!
6289               
6290 016147  4523          OVLJMP;OVREPL           / YES, CALL IN THE REPLACE OVERLAY
     016150  2204  
