7355               / SUBR RPXHLT PSUEDO-CODE:
7356               /
7357               /  take out GOLD_HALT support for both GTP and GOLD_HALT...   /A195
7358               /
7359               / Determine if the user has requested a halt via the GOLD:HALT
7360               /   key during a GOTO PAGE request;
7361               / If so, then
7362               /       RPBOTF := -1;   ( turn this into a GOLD:Bottom )
7363               /       jump to RPRULE; ( never returns to caller )
7364               / else
7365               /       ( user did not press GOLD:HALT )
7366               /       accumulate # of pages in document so far (in CURPG1);
7367               /       compare current page # with desired page # ...
7368               /       exit ...
