8407               / EXTRACTNUMBER ROUTINE ALONG WITH ALL ASSOCIATED SUBROUTIINES ARE
8408               /  CLASSIFIED AS IN EDIT HISTORY!!
8409               /
8410               /++
8411               /               EXTRACTNUMBER   EXTRACT_NUMBER
8412               /
8413               / FUNTIONAL DESCRIPTION:        EXTRACTNUMBER
8414               /
8415               / EXTRACT_NUMBER ROUTINE PERFORMS THE EXTRACTION OF NUMBERS FROM A LINE
8416               / OF TEXT WITHIN A DOCUMENT FOR THE PURPOSE OF PERFORMING EDITOR MATH.
8417               / IT ALSO CALLS MATH EXECUTION AND MATH INSERT_DELETE ROUTINES AS NEEDED.
8418               /
8419               / CALLING SEQUENCE:     JMP     EXTRACTNUMBER
8420               /
8421               / INPUT PARAMETERS:     AC = 0
8422               /
8423               / IMPLICIT INPUT:       GLOBAL: MTHWRK, NWDT, MTHTOT, CURPTR, LNEPC, TABFLAGS,
8424               /                               TABPOSITION, CRLMB, CRWMB, DTABCOUNT, T1
8425               /                       LOCAL:  SEIRF
8426               /
