9801 022144* 7650          SNA CLA                 / IS THE EDITOR IN SELECT MODE?
9802 022145* 5737          JMP I   CKSCLT          /  NO: RETURN TO CALLER TO CONTINUE PROCESSING
9803 022146* 4755          JMS     SCRINI          /  YES: SHUT MATH DOWN IN CASE SELECT DONE IN
9804                                               /       EDITOR MATH WORK AREA
9805 022147* 5754          JMP     BKEDIT          / RETURN TO EDITOR
