11404                       TAD     TABPOSITION     / HAS DTABCOUNT ALREADY BEEN INCREMENTED
undefined       	   	          ^
undefined       	   	          ^
     024055* 1000  
11405                                               /  FOR THIS TAB POSITION?
11406                       TAD     LTABPOSITION    / ADD LAST_TAB_POSITION
undefined       	   	           ^
undefined       	   	           ^
     024056* 1000  
11407 024057* 7640          SZA CLA                 / SKIP IF: SO
11408 024060* 2772          ISZ     DTABCOUNT       / NO - INCREMENT DECIMAL TAB COUNT
11409                       TAD     TABPOSITION     / SET LTABPOSITION
undefined       	   	          ^
undefined       	   	          ^
     024061* 1000  
11410 024062* 7041          CIA
11411                       DCA     LTABPOSITION
undefined       	   	           ^
undefined       	   	           ^
     024063* 3000  
11412 024064* 5654          JMP I   IDTABCOUNT      / RETURN
