12502               / THIS ROUTINE RETURNS A NON-ZERO CHARACTER, UNLESS THE END OF THE FILE IS
12503               / REACHED.  WHEN THE END OF THE FILE IS REACHED, THE ROUTINE CONTINUES TO
12504               / RETURN A ZERO EACH TIME IT IS INVOKED.  HOWEVER, THE END OF FILE MARK IS
12505               / NEVER REMOVED, SO THE ROUTINE MUST BE "CLOSED" IF LIST PROCESSING IS TO
12506               / TERMINATE.  TO DO THIS, SIMPLY CALL GETPRT WITH A NON-ZERO AC.
