15437                                               /  EITHER RESBUF OR RECBUF.
15438                                               / IF NO MATCH IS FOUND WE WILL RETURN
15439                                               /  HERE FROM THE JMS SO WE CAN GO TO
15440                                               /   FIELD NOT FOUND ROUTINE.  IF A
15441                                               /    MATCH WAS FOUND IN RECBUF THEN
15442                                               /     MFNIFD RETURNS TO MRGFSA (NOT
15443                                               /      HERE!!!!).  ALL FOR THE NEED OF
15444                                               /       SPACE.
