16960               /
16961               / HANDLE "GOLD SPACE"   (REQUIRED SPACE = EDRQSP)
16962               /
16963               / A "REQUIRED SPACE" IS A SPACE THAT WILL NOT BE USED AS A LINE BREAK
16964               / BY THE JUSTIFICATION ROUTINES (A NONBREAKING SPACE).
16965               /
16966               / "REQUIRED SPACE" IS IMPLEMENTED AS AN OVERSTRIKE SEQUENCE CONTAINING
16967               / TWO SPACES.  THIS APPEARS IN THE EDIT BUFFER AS:
16968               /      ECSTOV ECSPC ECSPC ECNDOV
16969               / (THE ECSPC CHARS MAY HAVE ATTRIBUTES SET.)
16970               / SUCH A SEQUENCE IS IMPOSSIBLE TO ENTER MANUALLY BECAUSE OVERSTRIKE
16971               / SEQUENCES MAY ONLY CONTAIN PRINTING CHARACTERS.
16972               / CONCEPTUALLY, SUCH SEQUENCES ARE HEREBY REDEFINED AS A "REQUIRED SPACE",
16973               / AND THUS MAY NOT BE MANIPULATED OR DISPLAYED AS OVERSTRIKE SEQUENCES.
16974               /
16975               / THIS ROUTINE INSERTS A "REQUIRED SPACE" INTO THE EDIT BUFFER.
16976               /
16977 047707* 4514  XVRQSP, SLNMOD                  / TELL FXSCRL WE'RE MODIFYING EDIT BUFFER
16978                       TAD     (ECSTOV)        / INSERT ECSTOV INTO EDIT BUFFER
