18031               / NEXT RULER IS NOT IN TEXT BUFFER OR ORIGINAL ETX (OR STX) BUFFER,
18032               / THEREFORE WE MUST USE GOTO-PAGE STRUCTURE TO FIND NEXT RULER.
18033               /
18034               / FIRST, SAVE WPFILS' FILE SYSTEM POINTERS, BECAUSE
18035               / READING SUCCESSIVE GOTO-PAGE DESCRIPTOR WORDS MODIFIES THE
18036               / FILE SYSTEM POINTERS, AND AFTER SCANNING DESC WORDS FOR A RULER,
18037               / WE NEED A WAY TO RETURN TO OUR STARTING POINT IN THE DOCUMENT.
18038               / WARNING: DO NOT PERFORM ANY CURMOV, ADVCHR, ETC. THAT INVOLVES
18039               / DISK SCROLLING AFTER MODIFYING THE FILE SYSTEM POINTERS,
18040               / OR ELSE THE DOCUMENT WILL BE CORRUPTED!
18041               
