18068               /D214   CDFSYS                                                          /A157
18069               /D214   TAD I   HLTFLG          / DID USER TYPE GOLD:HALT?              /A157
18070               /D214   SZA CLA                                                         /A157
18071               /D214    JMP    RRHLT           / YES: STOP WHERE YOU ARE               /A157
18072 047705* 0000          CDFMYF                                                          /A157
