18956               / DESIRED ENTITY IF IT EXISTS; OTHERWISE THE CURSOR IS AT THE
18957               / BOTTOM OF THE DOCUMENT -- UNLESS THE USER PRESSED GOLD:HALT!
18958               / IN ANY EVENT, PTRBLK HAS BEEN SET UP TO PAINT THE SCREEN PROPERLY.
