18980               /
18981               / ENTRY CONDITIONS:
18982               /   RRPS ASSUMES THE CURSOR IS IN COLUMN 0.                             /A157
18983               /   PTRBLK MAY BE TOTALLY EMPTY, PARTIALLY FULL, OR COMPLETELY FULL,    /A157
18984               /     BUT IT MUST NOT BE GARBAGE.                                       /A157
18985               /   MATH MUST BE TURNED OFF.                                            /A157
18986               /   IT IS BEST IF EDITOR'S STATUS LINE'S LINE # IS INITIALIZED
