19041                       / RULER OR PAGE).
19042                       /
19043                       / AS WE MOVE FORWARD TO POSITION MARKER,
19044                       / PTRBLK MAY FILL UP MORE IF WE HAD REACHED STX;
19045                       / REJUSTIFICATION WILL OCCUR IF NEEDED (USUALLY IT WON'T BE);
19046                       / AND MATH MUST BE TURNED OFF IN CASE CURSOR PASSES OVER
19047                       / A WPSMATH CONTROL BLOCK (SEE SWTHMA).
