21429                       EDSUBS^100+EDSUPS+100   / SUBSCRIPT             / SUPERSCRIPT
21430                       EDSWAP^100+EDTOP+100    / SWAP                  / TOP
21431                       EDUUDL^100+EDLOWR+100   / GOLD:UNDERLINE        / GOLD:UPPERCASE
21432                       EDVIEW^100+EDGBKP+100   / VIEW                  / UP ARROW=BACKUP LINE(**)
21433                       EDGADV^100+EDGBKP+100   / DN ARROW=ADVANCE LINE(**)/ LFT ARROW=BACKUP LINE(**)
