24695 057312* 2131          ISZ     PSTPTR          /BUMP PTR AND CHECK FOR BLOCK FULL
24696                       JMP I   PUTSTP          /BLOCK NOT FULL SO RETURN DIRECTLY
undefined       	     	     ^
undefined       	     	     ^
